{
  "slug": "openfunnel",
  "name": "Openfunnel",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "OpenFunnel is a live query engine over the movement and intent of 35M companies and 800M people.\n\nIt continuously monitors a live changelog of this activity, and lets GTM teams define and detect sequential patterns that indicate pain in natural language.\n\nWhen any company's state evolves in a way that matches your pattern, OpenFunnel fires an event instantly - piped directly to Slack or your CRM with the right people behind the change and what happened.\n\nOpenFunnel is built to detect leading indicators of pain in real-time.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **16 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (16): `account-scoring` (Score accounts 0-100 on pain-point relevance with evidence and reasoning), `advanced-account-setup` (Advanced account setup — ICP profiles, blocklists, and integrations (Salesforce, HubSpot, Slack)), `enrich-accounts-with-contacts-and-emails` (Enrich a list of company domains into account IDs, relevant contacts, and work emails), `enrich-and-research` (Look up a company, enrich it with people and signals, and get an attack strategy), `enrich-people-with-email-and-phone` (Enrich OpenFunnel people with work email addresses and phone numbers), `enterprise-account-research` (Break into F500 accounts — find which team has the pain, who leads it, and the evidence), `provision-user` (Create API-only OpenFunnel users on behalf of end-users), `score-and-tier` (Score accounts, bucket into tiers, and re-score as new signals come in), and 8 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install openfunnel@claude-community` from `openfunnel/openfunnel`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
